ESP-IDF v6.1 experimental DPP Connection Status Result follow-up
Base: fff9895c82d744c7237be8847347bdd1b07c6643 plus
      esp-idf-v6.1-dpp-configuration-result.patch
Prepared: 2026-10-19

Parse sendConnStatus, retain the authenticated session, and expose an optional
worker-task API to report verified successful association before DPP teardown.
The encoder follows the hostap BSD wire format. See patches/README.md.

